\details{
The dual is minimised here (convex) to match the package convention used by
\code{\link{inverse_noise}} and \code{\link{matrix_ce}}:
\deqn{
  \ell(\lambda) = -\sum_i \lambda_i y_i + \nu \sum_j \log\Omega_j(\lambda)
